# ── Resident data — never commit ──────────────────────────────
# Migration dumps carry real names, phone numbers and M-PIN hashes. Once
# pushed to GitHub they are in the history for good, and rewriting history
# on a shared branch is far more painful than this line.
Insert queries generated from Lite.txt
backend/scripts/migration/
*-import-to-gold.sql
*export-from-lite*.sql
